    "sections": {
        "description": "Bee Solar Company Theme is designed with a clean structure suitable for creating a professional website with a modern layout. It includes a responsive design that adjusts across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices for a consistent viewing experience. The homepage provides organized sections for banners, services, project highlights, testimonials, team information, and contact details. Built-in customization options allow changes to colors, typography, logo, menus, and layout settings without modifying the core files. The theme also supports featured images, social media integration, and blog pages for publishing updates or informational content. Its navigation is structured to help visitors move between pages with ease, while optimized code contributes to smooth performance. The layout is compatible with common plugins that extend functionality when required. It also includes footer widgets, call-to-action sections, and customizable headers to improve site organization. The overall design focuses on readability, structured content presentation, and flexible customization, making it suitable for building a well-organized website with a professional appearance and a consistent user experience across different screen sizes."
    },
